00:21:39.680 --> 00:21:42.600
They've collectively raised hundreds of millions in venture funding.

203
00:21:43.140 --> 00:21:45.460
They're good at it. They have users. They have infrastructure.

204
00:21:46.480 --> 00:21:51.100
Why compete with them? That would be very human of you. Partner instead.

205
00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:57.460
The protocol provides: It provides an open protocol for data exchange (like email protocols).

206
00:21:58.200 --> 00:22:03.860
It provides a federated data network (data stays in Epic/Cerner/Apple Health systems).

