The F.D.A.'s job becomes preventing people from becoming immortal too quickly (traffic is bad enough).

248
00:26:10.400 --> 00:26:15.140
The last F.D.A. form is filled out. It's immediately lost. Nobody notices.

249
00:26:15.900 --> 00:26:24.520
How Your Decentralized F.D.A. Actually Works. This approach is forty-four point one times more cost-efficient than the current

